# Clone this repo next to the RimWorld install (e.g. ~/RimWorld and ~/rim-mods/living-world), not into it:
# 1.7 keeps hundreds of game files in the install root. Never commit game files or decompiled game code.

# Local tool state and scratch (decompiled game code goes in .work/ and must never be committed)
